Note:
For every Story Mission listed below, there is a dynamic chance that Tanjiro Kamado (and his current party)
will spawn as friendly NPCs to assist in combat or dialogue.

I. Final Selection Arc
    Mission 0: Final Selection
    Location: Mt. Fujikasane

    Objectives:
        Enter the Mt. Fujikasane.
        Survive for 7 Days and 7 Nights.
        On the final night, the Hand Demon will spawn.
        You are not required to kill the Hand Demon. You may choose to run (evade) until sunrise or stand and fight for a higher starting rank.

II. Kidnapper’s Bog Arc
    Mission 1: Kidnapper's Bog
    Location: Northwest Town

    Objectives:
    Investigate the village for the demon's location. (No idea how we will be doing this.).
    Locate the Swamp Demon's portal.
    Kill the Swamp Demon.

III. Asakusa Arc
    Mission 2: Asakusa
    Location: Tokyo (Asakusa District)

    Objectives:
        Patrol the streets.
        Defeat the "Generic Demon" (Tutorial/Warm-up enemy).
        Narrative Trigger: Encounter the NPCs Tamayo and Yushiro.


    Mission 3: Tamayo
    Location: The Hidden Clinic

    Objectives:
        Enter Tamayo's hospital.
        Survive the ambush by Susamaru (Temari Demon) and Yahaba (Arrow Demon).
        Defeat both demons to clear the mission.

IV. Tsuzumi Mansion Arc
    Mission 4: Tsuzumi Mansion
    Location: The Drum House

    Objectives:
        Enter the Mansion. (Possible encounter: Zenitsu Agatsuma / Inosuke Hashibira).
        Eliminate the Tongue Demon.
        Eliminate the Horned Demon.
        Locate the master of the house.
        Defeat Kyogai (Drum Demon).


V. Mount Natagumo Arc
    Mission 5: Mt. Natagumo
    Location: Spider Forest (Outer Perimeter)

    Objectives:
        Locate and rescue the NPC Murata.
        Neutralize the Demon Slayer Puppets (controlled by threads).

    Mission 6: Mother's Doll
    Location: Spider Forest (Inner Perimeter)

    Objectives:
        Locate the Demon.
        Defeat the Mother's Doll (Mini-boss) and the Mother Spider Demon.


    Mission 6: Spider Family
    Location: Spider Forest (Deep Woods / River)

    Objectives:
        Defeat the Elder Brother Spider.
        Defeat the Father Spider (Tank Boss).
        Timed Boss Events:
            Engage the Daughter Spider.
            Condition: If you defeat within the Time Limit, then you get the loot.
            Condition: If the timer runs out, then Shinobu arrives and steals the kill.

            Engage Rui (Lower Moon Five).
            Condition: If you defeat within the Time Limit, then you get the loot.
            Condition: If the timer runs out, then Giyu arrives and steals the kill.

    Mission 7: The Traitor
    Location: Forest Outskirts

    Objectives:
        Locate Tanjiro and Nezuko.
        Escort them to the DSHQ (Demon Slayer HQ) for trial.


VI. Rehabilitation Training Arc
    Mission 8: The Lower Moon
    Location: Randomized City/Forest/Mountain

    Context: While Muzan is dismantling the Lower Moons, one has escaped or is currently being hunted.

    Objective:
    Track down and eliminate a Randomized Lower Moon (excluding Enmu).

VII. Mugen Train Arc
    Mission 9: Mugen Train
    Location: Steam Locomotive

    Objectives:
        Board the train and rendezvous with the Flame Hashira.
        Defeat the minor Train Demons infesting the carriages.
        You are put asleep; defeat the "Nightmare" version of your character in the dream realm to wake up.
        Boss Fight: Defeat Enmu (Lower Moon One) atop the train.


    Mission 10: Akaza
    Location: Derailed Train Wreckage

    Objectives:
        Boss Fight: Engage Akaza (Upper Moon Three).
        Win Conditions:
            Deplete Akaza's HP bar (Non-Canon Victory, but higher reward).
            Survive until sunrise (Canon Survival, but lower reward).

